1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,380
Sambungkan WhatsApp resmi lewat
Kapso ke Konektor.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,444
Di Kapso, buka Phone numbers,
lalu Set up number.

3
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:15,143
Pilih nomor US instan, SIM sendiri, atau
WhatsApp Business yang sudah ada.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,930
Ikuti jendela Facebook sampai Finish.

5
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:23,678
Buka Integrate, API keys,
lalu buat key baru.

6
00:00:23,678 --> 00:00:24,109
Salin.

7
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:31,159
Di Konektor, buka Hubungkan WhatsApp,
pilih Hubungkan lewat Kapso.

8
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:32,726
Tempel API key.

9
00:00:32,726 --> 00:00:34,212
Nomornya langsung terpilih.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:35,966
Klik Hubungkan.

11
00:00:35,966 --> 00:00:36,610
Terhubung!

12
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,127
Webhook terpasang otomatis,
tanpa setting tambahan.

13
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,474
Kirim satu chat uji.

14
00:00:44,474 --> 00:00:46,536
Langsung masuk ke Kotak Masuk.

15
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,536
Balas dari sini.

16
00:00:48,536 --> 00:00:49,869
Pelanggan lihat centang biru.

17
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:55,546
Panduannya, di konektor.id.
